      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IVORY JAPAN (2) was a solid 29.85 winner of a Grade 4/5 at Launceston last start. In form and looks the one to beat again. GOOD LUCK BABE (3) was out of the placings last time when seventh at this track (19.84) but did record second best time of the card when winning five back. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from 10 attempts. Can measure up this time. CARISSA'S BABY (6) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 5 lengths (19.59) at this track. Has never been out of the money in four starts this course and distance. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Likely to be about the money. DIP THE DONUT (1) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
